{"seq":4,"slug":"bundling-and-distribution","title":"打包与分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/nodejs-cli/bundling-and-distribution","wordCount":819,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"打包与分发\">打包与分发</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>打包与分发</strong>决定用户如何拿到并运行你的 Node CLI。关键权衡是<strong>是否要求用户预装 Node.js</strong>：要则用 npm/npx 最省事，不要则需打包成独立可执行文件。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分发方式</th>\n<th>需要 Node.js</th>\n<th>安装方式</th>\n<th>目标用户</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>npm publish</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>npm install -g</code></td>\n<td>开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>npx</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>npx mytool</code></td>\n<td>临时使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单文件打包</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>直接运行</td>\n<td>减少依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pkg 可执行文件</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>下载二进制</td>\n<td>非开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>docker run</code></td>\n<td>容器环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选定方式后，再用 esbuild 瘦身、用 <code>files</code>/<code>engines</code> 控制发布内容。本文从策略选择讲到打包与发布配置。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分发策略选择\">分发策略选择</h2><p>Node.js CLI 工具的<strong>分发</strong>（Distribution）方式多样，选择取决于目标用户群体和运行时要求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分发方式</th>\n<th>依赖 Node.js</th>\n<th>安装方式</th>\n<th>适用用户</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>npm publish</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>npm install -g</code></td>\n<td>开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>npx</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>npx mytool</code></td>\n<td>临时使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单文件打包</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>直接运行</td>\n<td>减少依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pkg/ncc</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>下载可执行文件</td>\n<td>非开发者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Docker</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td><code>docker run</code></td>\n<td>容器环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Node.js CLI 工具] --&gt; B{目标用户}&#10;    B --&gt;|开发者| C[npm publish]&#10;    B --&gt;|临时使用| D[npx]&#10;    B --&gt;|非开发者| E[pkg 打包]&#10;    B --&gt;|容器环境| F[Docker]&#10;    C --&gt; G[npm install -g]&#10;    D --&gt; H[零安装即用]&#10;    E --&gt; I[独立可执行文件]&#10;    F --&gt; J[镜像分发]\">graph TD\n    A[Node.js CLI 工具] --&gt; B{目标用户}\n    B --&gt;|开发者| C[npm publish]\n    B --&gt;|临时使用| D[npx]\n    B --&gt;|非开发者| E[pkg 打包]\n    B --&gt;|容器环境| F[Docker]\n    C --&gt; G[npm install -g]\n    D --&gt; H[零安装即用]\n    E --&gt; I[独立可执行文件]\n    F --&gt; J[镜像分发]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"esbuild-单文件打包\">Esbuild 单文件打包</h2><p><strong>esbuild</strong> 可以将整个 CLI 项目及其依赖打包为单个文件，大幅减少安装时间和磁盘占用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// scripts/build.mts&#10;import { build } from &#39;esbuild&#39;;&#10;&#10;await build({&#10;  entryPoints: [&#39;src/cli.ts&#39;],&#10;  bundle: true,&#10;  platform: &#39;node&#39;,&#10;  target: &#39;node18&#39;,&#10;  format: &#39;esm&#39;,&#10;  outfile: &#39;dist/cli.mjs&#39;,&#10;  minify: true,&#10;  treeShaking: true,&#10;  banner: {&#10;    js: &#39;#!/usr/bin/env node&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  external: [&#39;fsevents&#39;],&#10;  define: {&#10;    &#39;process.env.NODE_ENV&#39;: &#39;&quot;production&quot;&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;console.log(&#39;✓ 打包完成: dist/cli.mjs&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// scripts/build.mts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { build } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'esbuild'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entryPoints: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/cli.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bundle: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  platform: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'node18'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  format: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'esm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outfile: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist/cli.mjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  minify: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  treeShaking: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  banner: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    js: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'#!/usr/bin/env node'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  external: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fsevents'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  define: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'process.env.NODE_ENV'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'\"production\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'✓ 打包完成: dist/cli.mjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>esbuild 选项</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>bundle</code></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>打包所有依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>platform</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;node&quot;</code></td>\n<td>Node.js 环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>format</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;esm&quot;</code></td>\n<td>ESM 输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>minify</code></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>压缩代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>treeShaking</code></td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n<td>移除未使用代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>external</code></td>\n<td><code>[&quot;fsevents&quot;]</code></td>\n<td>排除平台特定依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>banner</code></td>\n<td>shebang</td>\n<td>添加可执行文件头</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 打包后的单文件不需要 node_modules，安装速度从分钟级降低到秒级。对于包含大量依赖的 CLI 工具，这是最有效的优化。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pkg-独立可执行文件\">Pkg：独立可执行文件</h2><p><strong>pkg</strong>（现由 <code>@yao-pkg/pkg</code> 维护）将 Node.js 应用打包为独立的可执行文件，用户无需安装 Node.js。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;mytool&quot;,&#10;  &quot;bin&quot;: &quot;./dist/cli.mjs&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pkg&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;targets&quot;: [&quot;node18-linux-x64&quot;, &quot;node18-macos-x64&quot;, &quot;node18-macos-arm64&quot;, &quot;node18-win-x64&quot;],&#10;    &quot;outputPath&quot;: &quot;release&quot;,&#10;    &quot;assets&quot;: [&quot;templates/**/*&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mytool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"bin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/cli.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pkg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node18-linux-x64\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node18-macos-x64\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node18-macos-arm64\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"node18-win-x64\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"outputPath\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"release\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"assets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"templates/**/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 pkg&#10;npm install -g @yao-pkg/pkg&#10;&#10;# 打包&#10;pkg . --targets node18-linux-x64,node18-macos-arm64,node18-win-x64&#10;&#10;# 输出&#10;# release/mytool-linux-x64&#10;# release/mytool-macos-arm64&#10;# release/mytool-win-x64.exe\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 pkg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @yao-pkg/pkg</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 打包</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pkg</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --targets</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node18-linux-x64,node18-macos-arm64,node18-win-x64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># release/mytool-linux-x64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># release/mytool-macos-arm64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># release/mytool-win-x64.exe</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>打包工具</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>Node.js 内嵌</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>esbuild</td>\n<td>单个 .mjs</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>减少依赖，快速安装</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ncc</td>\n<td>单个 .cjs</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>Webpack 打包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pkg</td>\n<td>独立可执行文件</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>用户无需 Node.js</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bun build</td>\n<td>独立可执行文件</td>\n<td>是 (Bun)</td>\n<td>Bun 生态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"npm-发布配置\">npm 发布配置</h2><p>发布到 <strong>npm</strong> 是 Node.js CLI 工具最标准的分发方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;@myorg/devtool&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;1.0.0&quot;,&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;全栈开发工具&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;,&#10;  &quot;bin&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;devtool&quot;: &quot;./dist/cli.mjs&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: [&quot;dist&quot;, &quot;templates&quot;],&#10;  &quot;engines&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;node&quot;: &quot;&gt;=18.0.0&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;keywords&quot;: [&quot;cli&quot;, &quot;developer-tools&quot;],&#10;  &quot;repository&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;type&quot;: &quot;git&quot;,&#10;    &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://github.com/myorg/devtool&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;license&quot;: &quot;MIT&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: &quot;node scripts/build.mts&quot;,&#10;    &quot;prepublishOnly&quot;: &quot;npm run build&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myorg/devtool\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"全栈开发工具\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shik